- Post the modules of the second half of the term.
- Send the grades before the faculty meeting.
- Review the attendance of students who miss class.
' AS BINARY)
  UNION ALL SELECT @sf0 + 5, CAST('Notes on journals

A journal entry has a date, the accounts, the debit and the credit, and a short explanation.
' AS BINARY)
) AS r WHERE @go = 1;

